  "description": "This library is a .NET 6.0 authorisation library that provides a permission-based security system, and is part of a larger microservices architecture where:\n\n - Users are authenticated via JWT tokens\n - Permissions are stored in a Dapr state store\n - Access control is managed through AD groups\n - Permissions can be scoped to specific sites/locations\n\nIt provides a building block for implementing fine-grained, permission-based access control in a distributed system.",
